<p style="color:#b8842e; font-size:0.8rem; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase;">// SYSTEM MESSAGE</p>

<h1 style="color:#e8e3f0;">Your password was just changed, <%= @user.crawler_name %>.</h1>

<p>If this was you, no action is needed.</p>

<p>If it wasn't, someone else may have access to your account (<%= @user.email %>) — change your password again immediately.</p>

<p style="color:#9a94a8; font-size:0.85rem;">You can turn these alerts off from your profile settings.</p>
